        2043,
        2825
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the Charter empowers the Mayor at any time, by Executive Order, to create or abolish bureaus, divisions or positions within his executive office as he may deem necessary to fulfill his duties and from time to time, by executive order, to delegate or withdraw from any member of said office, specified functions, powers and duties, except his power to act on Local Laws or Resolution of the Council, to act as a Magistrate or to appoint or remove officials,",
      "logprob_stats": {
