      "text": "There shall be created in the Human Resources Administration a bureau or division which shall be known as the Addiction Services Agency. This Agency shall be headed by a Commissioner to be known as Commissioner of Addiction Services Agency, who shall be appointed by the Mayor. The Mayor may appoint three Deputy Commissioners, one of whom shall be known as the First Deputy Commissioner.",
